  "steps": [
    "Meatballs. Mix everything well and roll into meatballs. Air fry at 190 °C for 7–8 minutes, shaking halfway, until cooked through.",
    "Rolls. Slice the tops off the bread rolls and scoop out a little of the middle. Brush the insides with garlic-parsley butter.",
    "Fill. Add the meatballs, spoon over Bolognese and top with mozzarella.",
    "Melt. Air fry 3–4 minutes more until melted and golden."
